@token = 

### Register a new player
POST http://localhost:5237/api/player/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "displayName": "Stormgate",
    "email": "jalapenojosh@gmail.com"
}

###

### Request OTP (after registration)
POST http://localhost:5237/auth/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "jalapenojosh@gmail.com"
}

###

### Verify OTP (replace 123456 with the code from your email)
POST http://localhost:5237/auth/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "jalapenojosh@gmail.com",
    "otp": "202577"
}

###

### Set the player's theme (see ThemeEnum: 0 General ... 10 Stormgate, 13 DarkLord)
POST http://localhost:5237/api/player/theme
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "theme": 10
}

###

### Get the logged in player's details
GET http://localhost:5237/api/player/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Try to register duplicate email (should return 409)
POST http://localhost:5237/api/player/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "displayName": "Derpi Pose Duplicate",
    "email": "Not for you"
}
